  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  ## Activate Celcom Sender

  Bruno: `admin/Activate Celcom Sender`

  Reverses `admin/Revoke Celcom Sender` - sets `active: true` again on the shortcode, keeping
  its existing `id`/`apiKey`/`partnerId`. `sms/send` requests for that `sender` start
  succeeding again immediately.

  Code source: `CelcomSenderControllerImpl.activateCelcomSender` / `CelcomSenderServiceImpl.activateCelcomSender`.
}
